# Elemix! dialogue font: code (u16 value, little-endian in ROM) = glyph at 0x352B74 + code*32.
# Gap slots in the gojuon grid render blank; 0024 is the one the script uses as a space.
# Duplicate glyphs (0110 = 家, 0192 = 者) are left out so they decode as [0110]/[0192] and roundtrip.
